# DART in the Caldera: off the road, over the lava sea. The bike flies
# anywhere in the band over the lava (high above where the road would be)
# and there is no jump. Rock pillars hang from the roof or rise from the
# lava: they hurt to touch and stop shots. At the end waits Major Rattle's
# missile jet: fans of straight missiles, and pairs that home in on the
# bike for a while. Brought down, it gives the blue card.
seed 1
game echounit
wait 5
cheat run
cheat mission 4
cheat section 3
wait 5
expect owl == 2
expect k_fly == 1
cheat knospawn
cheat kclear
cheat god
# no jump in the air
press B 1
wait 20
expect k_jumps == 0
expect k_z == 0
# up, well above the road's far edge
hold UP 60
expect k_y < 70
hold DOWN 40
cheat mortal
# a pillar rising out of the lava up to y 100, straight ahead: it hurts
cheat kpos 60 104
cheat kobj 17 120 100
wait 40
expect hp == 4
# shots stop on it and it stands
cheat kclear
cheat god
cheat kobj 17 200 100
cheat kpos 60 120
press A 1
wait 20
expect k_kind17 == 1
# Major Rattle at the end
cheat kclear
cheat kdist 27200
wait 5
expect k_boss == 1
expect k_kind19 == 1
botuntil k_homing >= 1 900
cheat kbosshp 1
botuntil k_card == 1 1200
expect k_boss_dead == 1
waituntil sec == 4 300
waituntil state == 6 300
expect owl == 3
expect s_cards & 4
